,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533016387,"data":"```python\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533018917,"data":"def ceil_div(a, b):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533021487,"data":"    \"\"\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533024135,"data":"    Calcula la división de a entre b redondeada hacia arriba (ceiling division).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533027084,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533029559,"data":"    Args:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533032098,"data":"        a (int): El dividendo, no negativo.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.53303471,"data":"        b (int): El divisor, positivo.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533037294,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533039774,"data":"    Returns:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533042317,"data":"        int: El resultado de ceil(a / b).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533044934,"data":"    \"\"\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533047566,"data":"    return (a + b - 1) // b\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":233.533053156,"data":"```\n"}
